Package: scr-resets-monitor
Version: 1.1.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: SCR project <noreply@localhost>
Depends: bash (>= 4.3), coreutils, util-linux, dpkg (>= 1.17)
Description: Reset history API and configurable SysV MONIT boot gate
 Records existing SEMA observations through Bash and preserves reset history.
 Selects a per-boot safe or normal MONIT profile through the existing reset API.
 Requires native SysV MONIT, NTP, logging, and watchdog keepalive at runtime.
 Uses Debian diversions and conffiles; never starts services during installation.
